WEBVTT

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:46.040
The Claws of a Crab Can Snip Through a Friendship

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:49.670
Whoa! Isn't this a crab, Gin-san?!

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:51.770
What's the occasion?

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:52.710
One of Gran's old friends

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:55.110
gave her so many that she's sick of eating them,

00:01:55.110 --> 00:01:57.550
so she's sharing the wealth.

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:58.760
Seriously?!

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:01.020
It's been forever since I've had crab!

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:02.870
Uh...

00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:05.430
She only gave us one?

00:02:05.670 --> 00:02:08.040
Yeah, she asked me how many I wanted,

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:10.320
so I told her I wanted a boxful...

00:02:10.570 --> 00:02:12.190
Damn hag!

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:15.130
Why is she giving us riddles like the Sphinx?!

00:02:15.130 --> 00:02:16.680
This isn't Ikkyu-san!

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:19.950
I'm gonna "riddle me that!"

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:21.750
Calm down, kids.

00:02:21.970 --> 00:02:22.930
Listen to me.

00:02:22.930 --> 00:02:25.210
Do you know why a crab has so many legs?

00:02:25.480 --> 00:02:28.090
So we can share them.

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:31.300
Since the beginning of time, humans have

00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:33.610
fought many foolish wars over crabs.

00:02:33.610 --> 00:02:34.990
Such as the Battle of Sekigahara

00:02:34.990 --> 00:02:36.970
and the Battle of Okehazama.

00:02:36.970 --> 00:02:38.350
Uh, that's news to me.

00:02:39.190 --> 00:02:41.650
And so, the Holy Crab in Heaven...

00:02:41.650 --> 00:02:42.910
What's a Holy Crab?

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:44.600
How did God turn into a crab?

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:46.750
Gave crabs more legs to end

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:49.300
the tragic conflicts and allow us

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:51.300
to eat crab together.

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:53.250
However, crabs could no longer

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:55.740
move forwards or backwards.

00:02:56.370 --> 00:03:00.000
Is it right to force the Holy Crab to live a sideways life?

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.300
Is it right to force him to purely go

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:03.630
scissors without any missionary or doggy style?

00:03:03.630 --> 00:03:05.870
This conversation has gotten very weird.

00:03:06.170 --> 00:03:08.410
Let's do this peacefully.

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:09.780
I'm sick of all the fighting over food,

00:03:09.780 --> 00:03:10.880
like whenever we have a hot pot.

00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:12.810
That's true.

00:03:12.810 --> 00:03:15.010
Let's share this crab.

00:03:15.300 --> 00:03:17.950
If we include the claws, this thing has ten legs.

00:03:17.950 --> 00:03:20.430
There's plenty for everyone here.

00:03:20.430 --> 00:03:22.980
But how do we split ten legs between three people?

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:24.190
One will be left over...

00:03:25.190 --> 00:03:26.770
Huh? What's going on?

00:03:26.770 --> 00:03:28.140
A blackout?

00:03:27.770 --> 00:04:07.520
Power outage at Yorozuya

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:29.140
What the hell?

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:30.620
We were getting to the good part.

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:32.490
I'll go check the circuit breaker.

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:35.090
Ow!

00:03:36.470 --> 00:03:38.310
Come on, staff.

00:03:38.310 --> 00:03:40.520
You're already out of steam after the Four Devas arc?

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:42.060
Stop slackin' off!

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:44.700
Wait, this was in the manga.

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:46.080
The author was overwhelmed

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:47.580
with that one-shot collection business.

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:48.200
What?

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:49.270
He wouldn't be doing one-shots

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:50.820
if he kept slackin' on his main series, stupid!

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:52.320
Yeah, stupid!

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:53.880
Super Legend, my ass!

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:56.090
A bunch of one-shots from big shots?

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:58.120
One of those guys clearly doesn't fit!

00:03:58.120 --> 00:03:59.700
There's a gorilla in the mix!

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:01.500
And he was unabashed about it!

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:03.560
Don't get too cocky, dammit!

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:05.740
What are you guys talking about?

00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:07.730
I just checked the circuit breaker and it's fine.

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:09.920
Power's back.

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:12.150
Okay, let's get started then...

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:15.520
Uh, excuse me...

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:18.400
The Holy Crab was injured during the blackout.

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:20.830
Maybe he bumped into the table?

00:04:20.830 --> 00:04:22.700
Yeah, a leg is missing.

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:25.820
It wasn't me!

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:28.760
I'm not evil enough to steal food while the power's out!

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:29.820
It obviously wasn't me!

00:04:29.820 --> 00:04:31.020
So it was one of you two!

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:32.420
What was that?!

00:04:32.420 --> 00:04:33.980
You probably swiped the leg

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:35.240
when you were pretending to go check the circuit breaker!

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:36.410
You said ow!

00:04:36.410 --> 00:04:37.990
You probably cut yourself on the crab!

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:39.870
I hit my head on the screen!

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:40.970
Hey, cut it out!

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:43.050
It's not possible to eat one

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:44.890
of those shelled monsters in the dark.

00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:50.130
Now, we have a number that divides perfectly into three.

00:04:50.130 --> 00:04:55.970
The Holy Crab must have been trying to stop us from fighting.

00:04:55.970 --> 00:04:57.990
Okay, enough bickering.

00:04:57.990 --> 00:04:59.240
Each of us gets three legs...

00:04:59.240 --> 00:05:01.420
You only get two!

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:04.610
Your mouth is bleeding because you didn't remove the shell!

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:06.710
How desperate were you?!

00:05:06.710 --> 00:05:08.540
What are you guys talking about?

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:11.560
When we were trashing that Legends mess during the blackout,

00:05:11.560 --> 00:05:14.320
a gorilla appeared and punched me hard.

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:15.800
Who would believe that story?!

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:18.630
The missing crab leg was also him, I'm guessing.

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:19.530
It's pretty bad.

00:05:19.530 --> 00:05:21.050
He must be completely stressed out.

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:22.560
Ah!

00:05:22.560 --> 00:05:24.440
Damn, another blackout.

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:38.190
Power outage at Yorozuya

00:05:24.440 --> 00:05:25.950
Gin-san, don't move an inch.

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:27.340
One more time and you're gonna get it.

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:28.870
Seriously, it wasn't me.

00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:30.010
Cross my heart and hope to die.

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:31.020
Careful, guys.

00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:33.500
We don't know when the gorilla will come back.

00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:34.950
Kagura-chan?!

00:05:34.950 --> 00:05:36.040
Stop!

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:38.190
Hey! What's wrong, Kagura?!

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:41.830
Ka-Kagura-chan!

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:44.070
My eye... My eye!

00:05:43.430 --> 00:05:45.310
Hold on, Kagura!

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:46.810
It's okay.

00:05:46.810 --> 00:05:48.950
You just have a cut on your eyelid.

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:50.260
A gorilla...

00:05:50.260 --> 00:05:53.780
A weird gorilla showed up and took a crab leg...

00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:56.040
I tried to stop it... But...

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:57.710
Look, Shinpachi!

00:05:57.710 --> 00:06:00.200
It took another crab leg!

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:02.090
This is all Legend Gorilla's fault!

00:06:02.430 --> 00:06:03.520
No way!

00:06:04.270 --> 00:06:04.850
Huh?

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:08.020
There's blood on the claw.

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:09.650
Didn't you just cut your eye

00:06:09.650 --> 00:06:11.460
on the claw when you tried

00:06:11.460 --> 00:06:12.860
to eat a crab leg in the dark?

00:06:12.860 --> 00:06:14.020
No!

00:06:14.460 --> 00:06:15.360
The gorilla!

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:19.150
The gorilla grabbed the crab and stabbed me with it!

00:06:19.390 --> 00:06:21.780
Uh, you're talking with your mouth full.

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:22.890
No!

00:06:22.890 --> 00:06:26.700
I fought back and bit off the gorilla's crotch!

00:06:26.910 --> 00:06:27.940
Damn gorilla...

00:06:27.940 --> 00:06:29.420
That should teach you a lesson.

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:31.530
Enough of this crap.

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:33.650
Stop blaming the gorilla for everything!

00:06:33.650 --> 00:06:36.170
It's so obvious that you ate those crab legs!

00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:37.710
No, we didn't.

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:40.300
It was the gorilla. The gorilla ate them.

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:43.360
You refuse to own up, huh...

00:06:43.700 --> 00:06:46.390
Fine, have it your way.

00:06:48.230 --> 00:06:50.500
We'll use a candle to prevent any further cheating

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:51.680
if the power goes out.

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:52.780
Oh, good idea.

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:55.100
Should have done this earlier.

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:57.110
Not that I ever cheated.

00:06:57.110 --> 00:06:58.680
I didn't cheat,

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:01.060
but this should keep that gorilla away.

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:02.960
Since gorillas are afraid of fire.

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:05.500
Then I'll divide up the legs so we can eat.

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:07.370
Sure, go ahead.

00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:08.950
Give me a claw.

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:10.450
I like the tougher meat.

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:14.250
Okay, that should put an end to their thievery.

00:07:14.610 --> 00:07:16.690
If the power goes out, we'll still have light from the candle.

00:07:16.690 --> 00:07:19.820
Most importantly, the crab is in my hands.

00:07:20.930 --> 00:07:22.780
Oh, the power went out again.

00:07:22.780 --> 00:07:24.400
Something's wrong today.

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:26.340
What's going on?

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:28.920
I'll go check the circuit breaker.

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.180
I'll come with you.

00:07:30.600 --> 00:07:32.170
I'm gonna borrow a candle.

00:07:35.440 --> 00:07:37.400
Huh? What are they doing?

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:39.860
They're leaving me alone with the crab?

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:42.610
The crab is undefended!

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:44.000
Is this a trap?!

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:45.520
Or are they letting me have my way with it?

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:47.620
Yes, this is the perfect chance!

00:07:47.620 --> 00:07:48.660
I should go for it!

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:51.560
They already swiped two legs!

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:53.840
I don't have time to waste!

00:07:55.460 --> 00:07:56.130
Huh?

00:07:56.710 --> 00:07:58.080
There aren't any legs left...

00:07:58.380 --> 00:08:00.340
Huh? This candle won't light.

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:02.090
This one won't either.

00:08:02.090 --> 00:08:02.910
Nor this one.

00:08:02.910 --> 00:08:04.030
Hey, Gin-chan.

00:08:04.030 --> 00:08:06.090
These aren't candles...

00:08:07.410 --> 00:08:08.470
They're crab legs.

00:08:08.470 --> 00:08:09.470
What?!

00:08:09.850 --> 00:08:11.800
Oh, you're right.

00:08:11.810 --> 00:08:14.980
That was when I realized how foolish I was.

00:08:15.530 --> 00:08:18.330
When I chose to focus on how to divide the legs among three people...

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:21.450
How to squirrel the extra leg away from them...

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:23.130
I was thinking too small.

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:26.490
I lost before I even sat down at the table.

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:31.490
They never had any intention of sharing a single crab leg.

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:34.750
My tiny claw could never pierce

00:08:34.750 --> 00:08:38.000
through their shamelessly thick shells.

00:08:39.170 --> 00:08:41.320
I will never stand a chance

00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:43.240
until I bring out my own giant claws

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:44.890
for plundering the entire world of every last crab!

00:08:47.430 --> 00:08:51.200
What's up with all the outages?

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:54.660
Let's try to get this crab party started again.

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:55.350
No...

00:08:55.850 --> 00:08:58.690
Only the body and claws are left.

00:08:58.940 --> 00:09:00.190
What's done is done.

00:09:00.190 --> 00:09:01.690
I wasn't expecting people

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:03.380
to mistake crab legs for candles.

00:09:03.380 --> 00:09:05.350
In what world would you find people who

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:06.570
mistake crab legs for candles?

00:09:06.920 --> 00:09:10.280
It's Shinpachi's fault for leaving the crab legs next to the candles.

00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:11.830
And you're trying to shift the blame to me

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:13.080
instead of apologizing!

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:15.530
Well, it was an honest mistake.

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:16.720
Let's forgive him.

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:18.850
You're so mature, Gin-chan!

00:09:18.850 --> 00:09:19.960
Hey, Shinpachi.

00:09:19.960 --> 00:09:22.320
Divide the crab into three equal portions.

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:27.590
How can you people have the gall to talk about equal?!

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:29.160
I want to hit them!

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:30.540
Punch them in the face!

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:33.720
But if I lose my cool now, they'll win!

00:09:34.370 --> 00:09:37.030
They've been trying to goad me into snapping

00:09:37.030 --> 00:09:38.230
with their heavy-handed behavior.

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:41.250
Forget that shit!

00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:42.860
You guys already ate eight crab legs!

00:09:42.860 --> 00:09:44.330
Three equal portions, my foot!

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:45.940
The rest is mine!

00:09:46.290 --> 00:09:47.880
That's what they want me to say.

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:50.880
But they'll have a response prepared.

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:52.450
Don't be stupid.

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:55.400
Two of the legs were eaten by that gorilla.

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:58.020
We each ate three of the remaining six.

00:09:58.020 --> 00:09:59.200
By mistake, I mean...

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:01.080
Thanks to someone else's mistake...

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:04.390
Well, you can have the two claws with the tougher meat.

00:10:04.390 --> 00:10:06.860
But we're sharing the body.

00:10:07.380 --> 00:10:09.470
They'll use some kind of absurd logic to

00:10:09.470 --> 00:10:12.130
declare that two claws are equal to four legs.

00:10:12.680 --> 00:10:16.350
That's why he said that line.

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:18.460
Give me a claw.

00:10:18.460 --> 00:10:20.640
I like the tougher meat.

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:23.310
He was trying to inflate the value of the claws

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:25.310
as part of his strategy to fool me.

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:27.650
But it's all a lie!

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:31.310
The claw may look like it has more than a leg,

00:10:31.310 --> 00:10:33.790
but in reality, it's the same amount of meat!

00:10:33.790 --> 00:10:36.860
That guy was feigning interest in

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:39.160
the claws so he could be rid of them!

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:49.130
He'll use the claws to distract

00:10:49.130 --> 00:10:51.420
me while he aims straight for the body!

00:10:51.650 --> 00:10:52.790
I won't let that happen!

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:54.430
I'm going to fight back!

00:10:54.760 --> 00:10:56.130
Fine then.

00:10:56.130 --> 00:11:00.050
I'll let you guys have the claws.

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:02.680
Which means I'm stuck with the body.

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:05.420
C-Could it be...

00:11:05.420 --> 00:11:07.860
He's using my statement about the claws

00:11:07.860 --> 00:11:09.690
against me, to lock me down?!

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:13.060
Despite all my taunting,

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:15.110
he's stayed calm and seen right through my plan,

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:16.630
completely ignoring the claws

00:11:16.630 --> 00:11:19.130
and going straight for the body!

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:22.080
And he's pretending that he's doing us a favor

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:24.290
by taking the body so he can win over the kid.

00:11:24.290 --> 00:11:29.000
A technique practiced by dads around the world!

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:32.850
I don't like the body cause it's all squishy and gross.

00:11:32.850 --> 00:11:34.050
Same here.

00:11:34.070 --> 00:11:36.900
But if you like crab legs so much, I'll take the body.

00:11:36.900 --> 00:11:39.420
Yes, the body of a crab is disgusting.

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:41.600
Women and children tend to avoid it.

00:11:41.600 --> 00:11:43.480
But the dad knows

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:49.190
that the body contains Princess Crab-Paste!

00:11:49.590 --> 00:11:51.230
Shi-Shinpachi...

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:53.350
You already know the secret of

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:55.700
Princess Crab-Paste at such a young age?!

00:11:56.830 --> 00:11:58.620
Indeed, Princess Crab-Paste is the

00:11:58.620 --> 00:12:00.300
ugliest woman of the Sengoku period.

00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:02.700
Yet you know that her repulsive face hides...

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:07.920
...the finest lay of the Sengoku period!

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:12.210
Gin-san, you may have won some small skirmishes,

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:14.720
but you haven't won the war.

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:16.670
You must take the body...

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:18.520
Take Princess Crab-Paste...

00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:21.090
if you wish to become a Crabqueror!

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:25.480
I will be the one who conquers the world!

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:29.350
Princess Crab-Paste!

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:31.320
Are you all right?

00:12:31.650 --> 00:12:34.190
Don't worry! Everything will be okay!

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:37.110
The Shimura army will keep you safe!

00:12:37.410 --> 00:12:39.570
The Sakata army approaches.

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:40.650
It is too dangerous here!

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:42.330
We must escape at once!

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:46.460
Th-That's...

00:12:46.970 --> 00:12:48.080
That's impossible...

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:50.670
Pr-Princess Crab-Paste...

00:12:50.670 --> 00:12:52.290
Princess Crab-Paste?

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:56.670
Who are you talking about?

00:12:58.820 --> 00:13:00.990
I-Impossible!

00:13:00.990 --> 00:13:02.570
It isn't just Princess Crab-Paste!

00:13:02.570 --> 00:13:03.510
The body is...

00:13:04.110 --> 00:13:05.520
...completely empty!

00:13:05.520 --> 00:13:07.480
Oh, sorry, Shinpachi.

00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:10.740
I took the meat from the body and cooked it with rice.

00:13:10.740 --> 00:13:12.860
Oh, I saved the crab paste.

00:13:16.030 --> 00:13:19.490
C-Cooked it with rice?!

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:24.640
How unfortunate, General Shimura.

00:13:24.640 --> 00:13:27.900
This castle belongs to the Sakata army now!

00:13:27.900 --> 00:13:30.210
And Princess Crab-Paste has fallen into our hands!

00:13:30.210 --> 00:13:33.790
This castle no longer holds any strategic value!

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:35.020
It can't be...

00:13:35.590 --> 00:13:37.210
General Sakata...

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:41.180
You anticipated that I would anticipate your plan?!

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:42.970
Absolutely not.

00:13:42.970 --> 00:13:45.720
But in war,

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:49.690
the key is to become a coward with multiple back-up plans.

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:51.410
N-No...

00:13:51.410 --> 00:13:53.110
He knew all along...

00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:56.570
...that my focus was on the body.

00:13:56.570 --> 00:14:01.400
And to fool me, he restored the body after taking its contents,

00:14:01.410 --> 00:14:03.160
and pretended to be Princess Crab-Paste.

00:14:03.160 --> 00:14:06.760
Yes, while I was falling into his trap,

00:14:06.760 --> 00:14:10.790
he was taking possession of the ultimate sword, Crabclaw!

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:13.670
Yeah. Sorry, Pachi-boy.

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:15.400
We even took the claws.

00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:18.130
You ended up without a single bite of crab.

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:19.630
I misjudged him!

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:21.760
But it's not our fault.

00:14:21.760 --> 00:14:24.030
You're the one who let us have them.

00:14:24.030 --> 00:14:26.820
You have sunk your fangs into the crab shell,

00:14:26.820 --> 00:14:28.640
Gintoki the Viper!

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:32.070
Well, I'll help myself then.

00:14:35.840 --> 00:14:36.830
The meat!

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:39.190
The meat of the Crabclaw is gone!

00:14:41.070 --> 00:14:42.950
The meat is right here.

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:44.450
Ta-da!

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:46.870
Da-Daigoro!

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:50.830
You're so weird, Gin-chan.

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:52.750
Why do you like the claws so much?

00:14:52.750 --> 00:14:56.110
There's more meat in the leg below the claw.

00:14:56.110 --> 00:14:56.960
Silly Gin-chan.

00:14:57.710 --> 00:14:59.760
I spent too much time talking about claws!

00:15:00.110 --> 00:15:02.360
Technically, the term claw only

00:15:02.360 --> 00:15:04.460
refers to the pincer at the very end!

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:08.760
Still, I never expected her to divide up the claws like this!

00:15:09.330 --> 00:15:12.990
I ignored you since I assumed you were just a child,

00:15:12.990 --> 00:15:15.310
but you took advantage of my battle with General Shimura

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:17.520
to use my own words against me.

00:15:17.860 --> 00:15:21.310
Daigoro, you are no ordinary Daigoro!

00:15:24.970 --> 00:15:26.820
You were sent by Iga?!

00:15:29.350 --> 00:15:30.830
You aren't the only one

00:15:30.830 --> 00:15:31.990
who intends to take advantage

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:33.640
of the chaos and conquer this world.

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:36.540
A true tactician would lay low until

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:39.500
he's already conquered the world in secret!

00:15:39.720 --> 00:15:40.920
Viper!

00:15:40.920 --> 00:15:44.210
I grant you an eternal slumber inside that empty shell!

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:49.740
Not yet...

00:15:49.740 --> 00:15:53.970
I can still conquer the world...

00:15:54.920 --> 00:15:57.270
I may have lost the claws,

00:15:57.270 --> 00:16:00.980
but I used the treasures of the castle to create a new paradise!

00:16:04.320 --> 00:16:06.910
Castle Crab-on-Rice belongs to me!

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:09.660
And Princess Crab-Paste is in my hands!

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:12.660
As long as I hold these, my ambition will never die!

00:16:12.800 --> 00:16:15.210
Lord Viper! Look over there!

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:18.240
A castle is being constructed

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:20.880
next to ours at an alarming pace!

00:16:21.240 --> 00:16:22.460
Th-That's...?!

00:16:24.090 --> 00:16:26.760
Castle Crab-Juice!

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:28.080
I-Impossible!

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:30.370
This man has gathered his surviving forces

00:16:30.370 --> 00:16:32.890
and begun to build a castle!

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:33.970
Gin-san!

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:36.040
There's more to a crab than its meat!

00:16:36.040 --> 00:16:38.650
Even the shell has its flavor!

00:16:38.740 --> 00:16:39.990
Curse you!

00:16:39.990 --> 00:16:42.880
You plan to pit leftover juices against my crab-on-rice

00:16:42.880 --> 00:16:44.650
and reverse the situation?!

00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:50.520
This is your last chance to seek a peaceful resolution, Viper!

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:52.450
Grant me the right to access Castle Crab-on-Rice

00:16:52.450 --> 00:16:54.660
and meet with Princess Crab-Paste!

00:16:54.670 --> 00:16:55.760
Preposterous!

00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:58.020
How dare you seek to bargain

00:16:58.020 --> 00:17:00.790
on equal footing with me, the Crabqueror?!

00:17:00.970 --> 00:17:02.660
Who said anything about equal footing?!

00:17:02.670 --> 00:17:03.950
I, Shimura Shinpachi,

00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:07.600
demand seventy percent of Castle Crab-on-Rice!

00:17:07.600 --> 00:17:09.030
S-Seventy percent?!

00:17:09.030 --> 00:17:11.800
You overestimate what you hold!

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:13.810
You have dug your own grave, Viper!

00:17:14.150 --> 00:17:18.280
Crab on rice may sound delicious,

00:17:18.280 --> 00:17:22.820
but in reality, it barely tastes any different from plain rice!

00:17:22.820 --> 00:17:26.320
Yes, alone, crab on rice holds no power!

00:17:26.680 --> 00:17:29.070
Your castle serves as little more than decoration!

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:31.180
Crab on rice requires flavorful vegetables

00:17:31.180 --> 00:17:33.580
which have been cooked in crab juice!

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:35.710
You can no longer survive

00:17:35.710 --> 00:17:37.580
in the Sengoku period without me!

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:39.180
Don't be ridiculous!

00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:42.820
You have underestimated the potency of my hand-salted rice!

00:17:42.820 --> 00:17:44.290
Fire!

00:17:47.650 --> 00:17:49.310
It's no use, Lord Viper!

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:50.930
There isn't enough flavor!

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:54.680
Fire!

00:17:56.320 --> 00:17:58.080
Such firepower!

00:17:58.080 --> 00:17:59.640
The crab juice is strong in him!

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:01.500
Wh-What did you say?!

00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:04.400
This is like Gian vs. Nobita!

00:18:04.400 --> 00:18:07.720
We're a perfect match!
The ultimate combination!

00:18:07.720 --> 00:18:09.400
Best friends forever!

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:12.070
It's over, Viper!

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:14.320
Time to let me take over the world!

00:18:14.790 --> 00:18:15.750
Silence!

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:19.120
I have my own Doraemon in Princess Crab-Paste!

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:22.960
Wh-What?!

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:24.290
This shaking...

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:27.550
It'll taste better this way.

00:18:34.680 --> 00:18:35.890
Tha-

00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:36.720
That's...

00:18:37.390 --> 00:18:38.720
That's...!

00:18:40.610 --> 00:18:42.290
The castle in the sky!

00:18:40.610 --> 00:18:44.610
Note: Referring to Laputa: Castle in the Sky the film written and directed by Hayao Miyazaki.

00:18:42.270 --> 00:18:44.610
Crab-Congee-Laputa!

00:18:45.230 --> 00:18:46.510
I-Impossible!

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:48.610
Castle Crab-on-Rice and Castle Crab-Juice

00:18:48.610 --> 00:18:52.490
were taken over and combined into one?!

00:18:52.910 --> 00:18:55.990
She's stolen our cooking to create the ultimate recipe

00:18:55.990 --> 00:18:58.240
and lay claim to the mantle of conqueror!

00:18:58.670 --> 00:19:00.290
You're...!

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:03.120
You're no ordinary assassin of Iga!

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:05.130
Exactly.

00:19:05.690 --> 00:19:08.380
I'm neither Daigoro nor an assassin of Iga.

00:19:09.890 --> 00:19:13.780
My true name is Kagura Crab Congee Laputa.

00:19:13.760 --> 00:19:15.390
A descendant of the royal family

00:19:15.390 --> 00:19:18.140
which ruled over the ancient city of Crab-Congee-Laputa.

00:19:18.810 --> 00:19:20.770
I have been waiting for this moment,

00:19:20.770 --> 00:19:24.560
when you would unlock the path to Crab-Congee-Laputa,

00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:26.160
for I never could have

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:29.910
cooked crab on rice or vegetables in crab juice on my own.

00:19:29.910 --> 00:19:31.800
Excellent work.

00:19:31.800 --> 00:19:33.860
I appreciate your efforts.

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:35.650
In return, I shall give you

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:37.850
a demonstration of the true power of crab!

00:19:50.380 --> 00:19:54.340
O-One egg can cause this much damage?!

00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:57.430
A little stirring and the smell has me drooling!

00:19:57.600 --> 00:20:01.430
Th-This is the true power of crab!

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:04.820
Please stop her...

00:20:04.810 --> 00:20:05.440
Pr-

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:07.220
Princess Crab-Paste!

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:09.940
Stop fighting over crab!

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:13.500
Crabs were never meant to create conflict.

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:15.230
Crabs are meant to bring everyone

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:18.000
together around the table for a pleasant meal.

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:22.160
Wasn't that your original intention?

00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:25.250
Magnificent!

00:20:23.900 --> 00:20:25.960
It's not too late!

00:20:25.250 --> 00:20:27.960
The finest show on Earth!

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:28.460
The three of you can share this meal together.

00:20:28.460 --> 00:20:30.190
It's too late.

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:34.280
Our souls are enraged by the long battle.

00:20:34.280 --> 00:20:35.970
We can never bury this hatchet.

00:20:36.620 --> 00:20:37.960
It will be fine.

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:39.800
I will help to mend fences.

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:44.660
The savory flavor of crab paste is gentle as the ocean.

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:47.060
I'm sure that it will soothe your souls

00:20:47.060 --> 00:20:49.310
and restore your kind nature.

00:20:49.850 --> 00:20:56.290
Now, speak the words of unity and add me to the pot.

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:02.620
Balse appetit.

00:21:12.420 --> 00:21:13.420
Forget it.

00:21:14.030 --> 00:21:16.460
You can have the rest.

00:21:22.900 --> 00:21:24.990
Let's get this crab party restarted...

00:21:24.990 --> 00:21:28.510
No, let's get this crab party started.

00:21:28.510 --> 00:21:30.600
Sure, you have forty seconds to get ready.

00:21:45.180 --> 00:21:48.000
It tastes too fishy.

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:49.790
Imitation crab is better.

00:21:52.870 --> 00:21:55.420
Yes, that's right.

00:21:55.420 --> 00:21:57.090
Crab-Flavored Sausage

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:01.360
Band together

00:22:02.530 --> 00:22:06.620
to eat cheap food!

00:23:40.110 --> 00:23:44.990
People Forget to Return Stuff All the Time Without Even Realizing It

00:23:40.500 --> 00:23:41.500
Next time:

00:23:41.500 --> 00:23:44.990
People forget to return stuff all the time without even realizing it!
